    },
    "%@. %@.": {
      "comment": "Spoken step announcement for a timed step (step name, then how long) or an effort-led distance step (step name, then how far, no pace). Matches the phone's ttsStepDuration in apps/mobile_android/lib/l10n/app_*.arb; ja joins with full-width stops.",
